  "description": "*“Thank goodness, I’m the first one to spend the night with you.”*\n\nHye-Yoon, who became the eldest daughter of a prestigious family, was only a pretense of being a wife to her sick husband. However, due to her deceased husband’s will, all the circumstances surrounding her suddenly change. She must marry one of his half-brothers. However, instead of rejecting the will, the three brothers all step forward to take her as their wife, and she, who has no choice but to choose one of them, faces a new problem.\n\n*“According to tradition, a wife must spend one night with each of her brothers. After that, she can marry the one she wants from among them.”*\n\nWhat choice will she make? \n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
